# Final Confidence Score weights (spec §19 — "STRUCTURE + HTF + ENTRY SETUP
# must matter more than one oscillator"). Replaces the flat majority-vote-
# weighted table: "trend" is retained and still computed/shown in Technical
# Confirmation, but the final score is now driven by the hierarchical
# HTF-Bias/Entry-Confirmation model (ea_compute_htf_bias/
# ea_compute_entry_confirmation, see ea_generate_signal) instead of raw
# cross-timeframe majority — htf_bias/structure/entry_confirmation together
# are 55% of the score, momentum/price_action/sr_proximity 30%, and
# mtf/news/volatility (secondary/contextual factors) 15%.
