# 📡 Live Chart — builds on the existing, already-shared market-data /
# indicator pipeline (ea_get_ohlc, ea_analyze_timeframe_bias,
# fetch_chart_image, ea_chart_vision_bias). No new symbol/timeframe/
# provider system, no fabricated data: a failure anywhere (OHLC, chart
# image, AI vision) is reported as unavailable rather than guessed.
